WEBVTT

00:00:15.775 --> 00:00:22.805
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:22.985 --> 00:00:29.985
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:30.925 --> 00:00:37.725
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.205 --> 00:00:44.865
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.175 --> 00:00:50.705
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:50.985 --> 00:00:54.415
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.185 --> 00:00:59.215
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.485 --> 00:01:05.055
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.785
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.595 --> 00:01:14.365
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.015 --> 00:01:34.645
Mansion of Terror

00:01:35.925 --> 00:01:37.395
So it is.

00:01:37.655 --> 00:01:38.755
What?

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:41.425
The one that got our monster.

00:01:42.165 --> 00:01:43.755
Oh, that!

00:01:43.995 --> 00:01:45.795
It was data drained.

00:01:46.205 --> 00:01:47.425
Data Drained?

00:01:47.505 --> 00:01:49.165
It's the ability to
rewrite the monster's...

00:01:49.405 --> 00:01:50.775
...data and weaken it.

00:01:51.745 --> 00:01:53.135
That kind of power.

00:01:53.505 --> 00:01:54.945
Only one person in "the World"...

00:01:55.275 --> 00:01:58.265
...possesses that ability.

00:01:59.785 --> 00:02:00.905
It's Kite!

00:02:01.055 --> 00:02:03.215
The legendary dot hackers?

00:02:03.585 --> 00:02:05.075
That name brings back memories.

00:02:05.185 --> 00:02:06.445
What should we do about it?

00:02:06.555 --> 00:02:09.455
Delete the meddler and it's bye-bye.

00:02:09.455 --> 00:02:10.555
How?

00:02:10.695 --> 00:02:11.985
How about that area?

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:13.325
That's a given.

00:02:13.425 --> 00:02:14.955
It'll be a cinch if we can lure him...

00:02:15.195 --> 00:02:16.395
...out there, a cinch!

00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:18.125
Hey!

00:02:23.605 --> 00:02:25.835
The ocean is great!

00:02:28.475 --> 00:02:30.415
What are you doing, man!

00:02:30.715 --> 00:02:33.735
Sorry! Oh, didn't we meet before?

00:02:34.045 --> 00:02:37.675
We must be connected
by the red thread of fate.

00:02:38.225 --> 00:02:40.555
Would you like to
form a party with me?

00:02:43.625 --> 00:02:45.785
Then, shall we live together?

00:02:46.965 --> 00:02:47.725
Just kidding!

00:02:48.295 --> 00:02:49.995
Give me back my summer!

00:02:50.195 --> 00:02:52.565
Hey, Shugo! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:02:56.505 --> 00:02:58.595
I bought this at the item store.

00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:00.235
How do I look?

00:03:01.215 --> 00:03:02.335
G... great.

00:03:02.945 --> 00:03:05.105
This is a rare item from
my cache of rare items.

00:03:05.215 --> 00:03:07.475
"School Swimming Suit". Isn't it nice?

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.615
Ohka is coming soon too!!

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.685
You'd like to keep me, wouldn't you?

00:03:19.525 --> 00:03:20.655
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:21.195 --> 00:03:22.255
Ohka!

00:03:22.895 --> 00:03:24.025
That form?

00:03:24.865 --> 00:03:26.265
What's wrong, Shugo?

00:03:26.335 --> 00:03:27.325
Nothing.

00:03:27.365 --> 00:03:29.965
He was probably having
naughty thoughts.

00:03:30.205 --> 00:03:31.395
Shut up Ohka!

00:03:31.545 --> 00:03:32.765
What are you doing here?

00:03:32.805 --> 00:03:33.675
Guiding.

00:03:33.845 --> 00:03:34.965
Guiding?

00:03:42.485 --> 00:03:43.745
Sanjuro.

00:03:43.985 --> 00:03:44.745
Oh!

00:03:45.255 --> 00:03:46.585
Rena. Shugo.

00:03:47.225 --> 00:03:48.655
There's something
important I need to say.

00:03:50.525 --> 00:03:51.685
Huh?

00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:08.745
Um... Sanjuro.

00:04:09.915 --> 00:04:11.275
Is "The World"...

00:04:11.615 --> 00:04:13.045
...is this game fun?

00:04:13.645 --> 00:04:14.445
Yes!

00:04:14.755 --> 00:04:16.145
That's a given!

00:04:16.715 --> 00:04:17.685
I see.

00:04:17.785 --> 00:04:19.915
But kids your age probably...

00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:23.145
...have so many other
fun things to do.

00:04:23.795 --> 00:04:24.985
Huh?

00:04:25.195 --> 00:04:26.885
Um... What is that?

00:04:27.295 --> 00:04:29.385
Moderation in all things.

00:04:30.165 --> 00:04:32.925
If you do something in
excess, it's not good for you.

00:04:34.235 --> 00:04:35.295
You mean to make those...

00:04:35.635 --> 00:04:38.005
...those two quit "The World"?!

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:40.605
Was it not you that said that the...

00:04:40.745 --> 00:04:41.645
..."Twilight" is coming?

00:04:41.945 --> 00:04:42.745
Kite's...

00:04:43.115 --> 00:04:46.345
No, Shugo's power
will be needed, right?

00:04:46.445 --> 00:04:48.845
This is only a game!

00:04:49.355 --> 00:04:52.715
Users gather together
here to have fun.

00:04:53.555 --> 00:04:55.285
That's the primary rule.

00:04:55.555 --> 00:04:57.755
There can be no exceptions.

00:04:58.165 --> 00:04:58.955
But...

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:01.755
As long as they don't wish it...

00:05:02.195 --> 00:05:04.325
...I cannot involve them in this.

00:05:05.335 --> 00:05:06.925
There were players
that have recently...

00:05:07.805 --> 00:05:09.895
...been involved that
have become unhappy.

00:05:11.945 --> 00:05:14.705
Why do we have to quit "The World"!?

00:05:15.445 --> 00:05:17.275
Well, an aquaintance of...

00:05:17.545 --> 00:05:19.275
...mine got addicted to "The World"...

00:05:19.345 --> 00:05:22.375
...and he's been
shunning the real world.

00:05:23.015 --> 00:05:24.715
I was a little concerned.

00:05:25.025 --> 00:05:29.485
We're fine. We know the difference.

00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:30.115
Yeah!

00:05:30.525 --> 00:05:32.085
Admirable words.

00:05:32.225 --> 00:05:33.155
But, it may be a good idea to stop...

00:05:33.295 --> 00:05:36.095
...playing "the World" for a little while.

00:05:36.635 --> 00:05:40.125
When you return, more
discoveries might await you.

00:05:40.505 --> 00:05:43.025
In order to make those
wonderful discoveries...

00:05:43.205 --> 00:05:45.235
...I want to become stronger.

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:46.905
You understand don't you, Master!

00:05:47.145 --> 00:05:47.905
Huh?

00:05:48.075 --> 00:05:49.105
Master?

00:05:49.945 --> 00:05:52.415
Master! I say, teacher!!

00:05:52.685 --> 00:05:55.015
Master. Teacher.

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:57.215
Such a lovely ring to it.

00:05:58.685 --> 00:05:59.655
At any rate...

00:05:59.785 --> 00:06:00.415
...there are plenty of events...

00:06:00.525 --> 00:06:04.015
...that we still have to clear.

00:06:04.295 --> 00:06:05.385
Events?

00:06:05.425 --> 00:06:05.895
Yeah...

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:07.995
...right after I started
playing this character...

00:06:08.435 --> 00:06:10.665
...a girl in white appeared and...

00:06:11.565 --> 00:06:12.695
...gave me this bracelet.

00:06:19.675 --> 00:06:21.305
Data Drain.

00:06:22.115 --> 00:06:25.445
I was asked "to save this world."

00:06:26.315 --> 00:06:27.945
Aura!

00:06:28.685 --> 00:06:32.145
After all, we're the dot
hackers characters.

00:06:32.625 --> 00:06:35.285
And there are special
events connected with that.

00:06:35.955 --> 00:06:39.185
Things that normal
players can't experience.

00:06:39.525 --> 00:06:42.055
Like monsters that won't die.

00:06:42.135 --> 00:06:42.995
Right, right!

00:06:44.065 --> 00:06:45.935
I cannot involve them in this...

00:06:46.465 --> 00:06:48.335
...so long as they don't wish it.

00:06:52.745 --> 00:06:54.865
It doesn't matter how trivial.

00:06:55.115 --> 00:06:59.305
That also goes for
entering unfamiliar areas.

00:07:00.815 --> 00:07:04.115
If you sense danger,
don't access for a while.

00:07:04.755 --> 00:07:06.985
There's no need to force
yourself to clear an event.

00:07:07.755 --> 00:07:08.455
But...

00:07:09.225 --> 00:07:11.785
"The World" is meant to be enjoyed.

00:07:12.295 --> 00:07:14.285
It's not a place where
you should risk your life.

00:07:16.495 --> 00:07:19.225
What was he trying to say in the end?

00:07:19.905 --> 00:07:23.095
Something like... an
hour a day for the game.

00:07:23.605 --> 00:07:26.935
He's so preachy, that Sanjuro.

00:07:26.975 --> 00:07:30.175
I wonder if he's a school
teacher in real life?

00:07:32.115 --> 00:07:33.745
It's alright isn't it? Just for a bit?

00:07:33.885 --> 00:07:34.675
Give it back...

00:07:34.985 --> 00:07:37.615
...that ball is the first item I've gotten.

00:07:37.755 --> 00:07:39.225
Take it, take it.

00:07:39.285 --> 00:07:40.415
That's good.

00:07:41.555 --> 00:07:42.755
Cut it out!

00:07:45.665 --> 00:07:49.065
She's a little girl! Have you no shame!

00:07:49.135 --> 00:07:50.155
Give back the ball!

00:07:50.265 --> 00:07:52.005
Hey, hey, HEY!

00:07:52.005 --> 00:07:53.335
Is it a strong opponent?

00:07:53.765 --> 00:07:55.065
Oh no, friends?

00:07:55.235 --> 00:07:56.765
Here, I'll return this!

00:07:57.705 --> 00:07:58.905
See ya, old maid!

00:08:00.105 --> 00:08:02.635
How rude! I'm still 14!

00:08:03.475 --> 00:08:05.505
My ball.

00:08:09.555 --> 00:08:10.385
Are you alright?

00:08:10.385 --> 00:08:13.125
Guys are such wolves, be careful.

00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:15.025
Women are wolves.

00:08:15.695 --> 00:08:16.525
I'm going home.

00:08:16.595 --> 00:08:17.685
O... Okay.

00:08:22.765 --> 00:08:23.895
Thank you.

00:08:24.265 --> 00:08:26.565
U, uh. No need to...

00:08:31.405 --> 00:08:32.565
How did it go?

00:08:32.845 --> 00:08:34.005
Piece of cake!

00:08:34.305 --> 00:08:36.775
We did it, we got the member address!

00:08:37.275 --> 00:08:38.905
Well then. Let's start.

00:08:39.285 --> 00:08:41.475
Operation Obliterate the Dot Hackers!

00:08:45.185 --> 00:08:46.585
I'm back.

00:08:51.295 --> 00:08:51.885
Mail?

00:09:07.845 --> 00:09:08.965
This is...

00:09:10.215 --> 00:09:11.335
Save...

00:09:12.145 --> 00:09:13.305
Me...

00:09:15.885 --> 00:09:18.215
This is hard to read.

00:09:19.755 --> 00:09:24.125
"Cursed Woodland Murderhouse"

00:09:24.595 --> 00:09:25.855
Is that what it said?

00:09:26.225 --> 00:09:29.195
My "corrupted text auto
decoder" from my...

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:31.695
...item stash managed to
translate the area name.

00:09:32.265 --> 00:09:33.065
But?

00:09:33.705 --> 00:09:36.535
The corruption was so
bad in the source...

00:09:37.205 --> 00:09:39.635
...I couldn't decode everything.

00:09:40.475 --> 00:09:43.565
But, we know what area the girl is in.

00:09:43.975 --> 00:09:46.145
Let's hurry and go save her!

00:09:48.315 --> 00:09:49.575
I'm itching to fight.

00:09:51.485 --> 00:09:53.215
A mail from Aura.

00:09:55.225 --> 00:09:55.885
No explanation.

00:09:59.925 --> 00:10:03.425
"Cursed Woodland Murderhouse"!

00:10:23.185 --> 00:10:24.585
This is?

00:10:24.685 --> 00:10:27.215
It's like something's waiting to happen.

00:10:27.385 --> 00:10:30.325
I smell a rare item!

00:10:32.665 --> 00:10:34.455
Rena, what's wrong?

00:10:34.495 --> 00:10:36.085
N- Nothing.

00:10:36.695 --> 00:10:38.855
Don't let your guard
down for a moment...

00:10:38.935 --> 00:10:39.455
...Shugo.

00:10:40.105 --> 00:10:42.295
I know, Sanjuro!

00:10:42.705 --> 00:10:44.365
Alright! Everyone, let's go!

00:11:10.635 --> 00:11:12.565
This is a brilliance that
cleanses the heart.

00:11:14.665 --> 00:11:15.765
Lord Balmung!

00:11:16.205 --> 00:11:18.535
Reki, I've completed the repairs here.

00:11:18.945 --> 00:11:20.035
I'll now be...

00:11:20.145 --> 00:11:21.335
Not now...

00:11:21.675 --> 00:11:25.335
...there's over 200 obstacle
claims that have come in.

00:11:25.715 --> 00:11:28.545
All the staff have given
up their day off...

00:11:29.055 --> 00:11:31.415
...to deal with it but the
claims just keep coming in!

00:11:31.755 --> 00:11:33.555
Is it just a coincidence?

00:11:33.885 --> 00:11:35.045
This area's abnormal weather?

00:11:35.855 --> 00:11:36.625
Reki.

00:11:36.625 --> 00:11:37.455
Yes.

00:11:37.455 --> 00:11:38.655
I'm leaving it to you.

00:11:39.395 --> 00:11:41.525
There is a place I must go.

00:11:48.165 --> 00:11:50.965
You're the ones that
altered the data just now?

00:11:51.305 --> 00:11:52.965
In the name of the Cerulean Knights...

00:11:53.105 --> 00:11:54.405
...you will be taken into custody!

00:11:54.775 --> 00:11:58.375
How rude! Who do
you think this man is?

00:11:58.545 --> 00:11:59.245
Don't know.

00:11:59.345 --> 00:12:00.545
You really don't know?

00:12:00.615 --> 00:12:01.585
How do I know?

00:12:01.615 --> 00:12:03.085
Don't joke.

00:12:03.155 --> 00:12:04.445
If I don't know, I don't know!

00:12:06.055 --> 00:12:07.185
Lower your swords.

00:12:08.725 --> 00:12:11.555
He is a system administrator here.

00:12:13.325 --> 00:12:14.425
Kamui!

00:12:15.765 --> 00:12:16.925
Balmung.

00:12:31.885 --> 00:12:33.075
Why are you here?

00:12:35.215 --> 00:12:37.815
The Cerulean Knights
have but one purpose.

00:12:37.915 --> 00:12:40.285
To protect order and peace.

00:12:41.285 --> 00:12:43.725
For that purpose, we
will go to any area.

00:12:44.395 --> 00:12:47.225
We are protecting the order
and peace of this server.

00:12:47.565 --> 00:12:48.685
I wonder.

00:12:48.935 --> 00:12:51.695
Trouble has been on
the rise here recently.

00:12:55.635 --> 00:12:58.735
Because Balmung is too
lenient with the users.

00:12:59.545 --> 00:13:02.205
I can't say that it won't
grow into a problem...

00:13:02.375 --> 00:13:03.535
...of bigger proportions.

00:13:05.615 --> 00:13:08.775
Place an activity monitor
in this vicinity for a while.

00:13:14.125 --> 00:13:16.455
So those were the
infamous Cerulean Knights?

00:13:17.195 --> 00:13:17.885
The ones that...

00:13:18.095 --> 00:13:19.755
...delete non-standard
characters without mercy.

00:13:20.495 --> 00:13:22.225
CC Corporation's System Division's...

00:13:22.535 --> 00:13:24.085
...Control Forces.

00:13:25.235 --> 00:13:26.595
The company's dogs.

00:13:38.885 --> 00:13:41.505
The girl is somewhere
inside this mansion.

00:13:41.955 --> 00:13:43.855
Rare Item. Rare Item.

00:13:44.015 --> 00:13:45.455
Where are the monsters?

00:13:49.325 --> 00:13:51.085
Are you hungry?

00:13:51.995 --> 00:13:54.465
Right now, your stomach,
it just made a noise.

00:14:03.635 --> 00:14:06.075
It appears to be a dining room.

00:14:17.615 --> 00:14:18.745
It's a bug.

00:14:19.455 --> 00:14:20.855
That scared me.

00:14:20.925 --> 00:14:24.355
Could it be that you're
easily scared, Rena?

00:14:25.265 --> 00:14:25.985
That's right...

00:14:26.225 --> 00:14:28.925
...she used to disappear whenever...

00:14:29.265 --> 00:14:31.025
...there was some scary special on TV.

00:14:31.535 --> 00:14:32.695
I'm right.

00:14:32.865 --> 00:14:35.065
Don't worry. I'm here.

00:14:35.105 --> 00:14:37.075
Reason aplenty to worry.

00:14:37.605 --> 00:14:38.835
I'll be fine.

00:14:39.005 --> 00:14:40.835
I'm perfectly fine in a place like this.

00:14:41.245 --> 00:14:44.505
No matter how real it
seems, it's just a game.

00:14:44.675 --> 00:14:47.045
Don't force it. I'm here with you.

00:14:47.345 --> 00:14:51.115
Shugo, just watch me not be scared.

00:14:51.155 --> 00:14:51.955
Rena!

00:14:51.955 --> 00:14:53.885
Don't! Give me some space!

00:14:55.955 --> 00:14:59.325
Is that so? Rena's easily frightened.

00:14:59.925 --> 00:15:02.865
I caught them coming here.

00:15:02.965 --> 00:15:05.195
It was worth it to come here.

00:15:07.305 --> 00:15:09.165
Nice situation!

00:15:10.705 --> 00:15:12.365
No! I'm scared!

00:15:14.645 --> 00:15:15.835
Rena!

00:15:17.415 --> 00:15:19.775
Komiyama, you're wonderful!

00:15:21.445 --> 00:15:23.675
Tres Bien!

00:15:28.895 --> 00:15:30.825
Hey. Which way do I go?!

00:15:33.125 --> 00:15:35.725
No way! Where is everyone?

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.995
I thought they'd come after me.

00:15:40.005 --> 00:15:41.595
It can't be helped.

00:15:42.405 --> 00:15:44.095
Well, I'll be fine.

00:15:44.175 --> 00:15:46.035
This is an artificial world.

00:15:50.375 --> 00:15:51.105
Rena!

00:15:51.415 --> 00:15:53.345
RENA!

00:16:08.735 --> 00:16:10.095
D... Don't come any closer!

00:16:10.095 --> 00:16:11.365
No!!! No!

00:16:27.245 --> 00:16:29.845
The voice came from that way. I think.

00:16:30.055 --> 00:16:31.845
Rena, are you all right?

00:16:32.425 --> 00:16:33.475
Don't let your guard down.

00:16:34.655 --> 00:16:37.285
It's dangerous to walk
alone in an unknown area.

00:16:37.695 --> 00:16:38.425
Let's catch up.

00:16:39.065 --> 00:16:39.455
Yes.

00:16:50.705 --> 00:16:52.365
This time it's real.

00:16:52.645 --> 00:16:53.575
A monster.

00:17:05.685 --> 00:17:06.985
You did it!

00:17:07.625 --> 00:17:09.815
Huh? You got the monsters...

00:17:10.025 --> 00:17:12.355
...but there's no treasure box?

00:17:28.445 --> 00:17:29.915
Shugo!

00:17:31.645 --> 00:17:34.375
Everyone. Where did you go?

00:17:36.115 --> 00:17:37.105
The Exit.

00:17:37.315 --> 00:17:38.645
Which way is it?

00:17:40.155 --> 00:17:41.455
I shouldn't have put up...

00:17:42.395 --> 00:17:43.825
...such a strong front.

00:18:05.175 --> 00:18:06.375
I don't like...

00:18:07.185 --> 00:18:08.145
...this place...

00:18:19.165 --> 00:18:21.025
Someone. Open the door!

00:18:35.745 --> 00:18:37.935
It was to lure out Kite.

00:18:38.675 --> 00:18:40.305
But the one caught in the trap...

00:18:41.045 --> 00:18:42.245
BlackRose, indeed.

00:18:51.325 --> 00:18:54.085
We've killed them so
many times already!

00:18:54.265 --> 00:18:55.425
Vak Don!

00:18:58.495 --> 00:19:00.395
These aren't normal monsters!

00:19:04.735 --> 00:19:07.175
